  "description": "<p data-end=\"476\" data-start=\"47\">&bull; <strong data-end=\"72\" data-start=\"49\">Brand introduction:</strong><br data-end=\"75\" data-start=\"72\">Kegismall introduces a curated selection of premium lifestyle products sourced from around the world, including beauty, health, culinary, and more. Our mission is to enrich and elevate everyday living, empowering individuals to craft a lifestyle that is uniquely their own. We take pride in offering products that reflect the values of those who cherish self-love and the well-being of their families.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"748\" data-start=\"478\">&bull; <strong data-end=\"504\" data-start=\"480\">Product description:</strong><br data-end=\"507\" data-start=\"504\">Kegismall offers a diverse range of high-quality, premium lifestyle goods that combine functionality with aesthetic appeal. Each product is carefully selected to meet global standards and provide practical solutions with a touch of elegance.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"785\" data-start=\"750\">&bull; <strong data-end=\"783\" data-start=\"752\">USP (Unique Selling Point):</strong></p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1030\" data-start=\"786\">\r\n<li data-end=\"837\" data-start=\"786\">\r\n<p data-end=\"837\" data-start=\"788\">Global sourcing of premium lifestyle essentials</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"890\" data-start=\"838\">\r\n<p data-end=\"890\" data-start=\"840\">Emphasis on wellness, beauty, and gourmet living</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"959\" data-start=\"891\">\r\n<p data-end=\"959\" data-start=\"893\">Products that reflect modern values of self-care and family care</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1030\" data-start=\"960\">\r\n<p data-end=\"1030\" data-start=\"962\">Tailored selections for creating a personalized lifestyle experience</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"1250\" data-start=\"1032\">&bull; <strong data-end=\"1052\" data-start=\"1034\">Payment terms:</strong><br data-end=\"1055\" data-start=\"1052\">Affiliates receive competitive incentives every two weeks, based on mutual agreement. High-performing affiliates are rewarded with elevated commission rates according to their sales achievements.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"1523\" data-start=\"1252\">&bull; <strong data-end=\"1276\" data-start=\"1254\">Other information:</strong><br data-end=\"1279\" data-start=\"1276\">Kegismall is committed to building long-term partnerships with passionate affiliates. We support our partners with flexible terms, strong marketing assets, and a shared vision for introducing high-quality lifestyle products to a wider audience.</p>",
